{"type":"message","id":"6bbe43e1","parentId":"11080b63","timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:38:21.574Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Yes — the deeper diagnostic portion of that answer was **based on the Doctor Agent’s assessment**, and I integrated it with your stored record and the smartwatch data before sending it to you.\n\nSo, in short:\n- **I** gathered your EHR/DNA context, asked the follow-up questions, and fetched the wearable data\n- **The Doctor Agent** provided the specialized preliminary diagnostic interpretation\n- **I** relayed it back to you in a patient-facing form\n\nIt is still a **preliminary assessment, not a confirmed diagnosis**. If you want, I can also separate out **exactly which parts came from your record, which came from the wearable data, and which came from the Doctor Agent’s interpretation**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00a790c6e0e38d1b0169ca60a9bd808191ab39c2091022b414\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":96787,"output":156,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96943,"cost":{"input":0.24196750000000003,"output":0.00234,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.24430750000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774870694542}}
